{"Saves the current result with cell/PBC, explicit bonds and orders, all particle properties, atom labels/visibility, particle styles and camera. Undo history, workspace snapshots and modifier steps are not stored. Open the .atomx file to continue editing.","保存当前结果：晶胞 / 周期边界、显式键及键级、全部原子属性、原子标签 / 可见性、样式和相机。不保存撤销历史、工作区快照和修改器步骤。打开 .atomx 可继续编辑。","Saves the current result with cell/PBC, explicit bonds and orders, all particle properties, atom labels/visibility, particle styles and camera. Undo history, workspace snapshots and modifier steps are not stored. Open the .atomx file to continue editing."},
{"Numeric precision","数值精度","Numeric precision"},
{"V2000: coordinates (4 decimals), single/double/triple/aromatic bonds and formal charges. Maximum 999 atoms and 999 bonds per record. Cell/PBC, periodic-image bonds, stereochemistry and arbitrary properties are not stored. SDF supports multiple records as frames.","V2000：坐标（4 位小数）、单 / 双 / 三 / 芳香键和形式电荷。每条记录最多 999 原子和 999 键。不保存晶胞 / 周期边界、周期像键、立体化学或任意属性。SDF 支持多记录作为帧。","V2000: coordinates (4 decimals), single/double/triple/aromatic bonds and formal charges. Maximum 999 atoms and 999 bonds per record. Cell/PBC, periodic-image bonds, stereochemistry and arbitrary properties are not stored. SDF supports multiple records as frames."},
{"PDB: coordinates (3 decimals), single-bond connectivity and formal charges; maximum 99999 atoms. Periodic cells use the conventional orientation. PBC axes, bond order, residues and arbitrary properties are not retained. Choose MOL/SDF for bond orders.","PDB：坐标（3 位小数）、单键连接和形式电荷，最多 99999 原子。周期晶胞使用标准取向。不保留各轴周期标志、键级、残基和任意属性。保留键级请选 MOL / SDF。","PDB: coordinates (3 decimals), single-bond connectivity and formal charges; maximum 99999 atoms. Periodic cells use the conventional orientation. PBC axes, bond order, residues and arbitrary properties are not retained. Choose MOL/SDF for bond orders."},
{"XSF: lattice vectors and positions in Angstroms, with X / XY / XYZ periodicity. Cell origin is subtracted from positions. Bonds, arbitrary properties, grids and animations are not stored.","XSF：晶格矢量和 Å 单位坐标，支持 X / XY / XYZ 周期。从坐标减去晶胞原点。不保存键、任意属性、网格和动画。","XSF: lattice vectors and positions in Angstroms, with X / XY / XYZ periodicity. Cell origin is subtracted from positions. Bonds, arbitrary properties, grids and animations are not stored."},
