{"Base radii from Cordero 2008 covalent radii. Per-type overrides take precedence; selection and color coding override type colors.","基础半径来自 Cordero 2008 共价半径。类型设置优先；选择与颜色编码可覆盖类型颜色。","Base radii from Cordero 2008 covalent radii. Per-type overrides take precedence; selection and color coding override type colors."},
{"Connected components follow the input bond topology; selected-only mode assigns ID 0 to other particles.","连通分量按输入键拓扑确定；仅选中模式将其他原子的编号设为 0。","Connected components follow the input bond topology; selected-only mode assigns ID 0 to other particles."},
{"Connected components follow the periodic minimum-image cutoff. Unselected particles get Cluster ID 0 when selected-only is enabled.","连通分量按周期最小像截断确定；仅选中模式将未选中原子的团簇编号设为 0。","Connected components follow the periodic minimum-image cutoff. Unselected particles get Cluster ID 0 when selected-only is enabled."},
{"Compares the current frame with the chosen raw input frame and publishes the Displacement vector and Displacement Magnitude particle properties. Non-periodic axes never use the minimum image convention.","对比当前帧与指定原始输入帧，生成 Displacement 矢量和 Displacement Magnitude 属性。非周期轴不使用最小像约定。","Compares the current frame with the chosen raw input frame and publishes the Displacement vector and Displacement Magnitude particle properties. Non-periodic axes never use the minimum image convention."},
{"Snapshots the property at the reference frame and restores those values on every other frame. Particles are matched by index or Particle Identifier.","在参考帧暂存属性，并在其他帧恢复；原子按索引或 Particle Identifier 匹配。","Snapshots the property at the reference frame and restores those values on every other frame. Particles are matched by index or Particle Identifier."},
{"Shared particle OBJ: triangulated, up to 256 triangles; centered and normalized to unit radius. High mesh counts cost more GPU time.","共享原子 OBJ：须三角化且不超过 256 个三角形；自动居中并归一化至单位半径。较多网格会增加 GPU 开销。","Shared particle OBJ: triangulated, up to 256 triangles; centered and normalized to unit radius. High mesh counts cost more GPU time."},
{"Coordination number and connected clusters using spatial bins and minimum-image periodic distances.","通过空间分箱和周期最小像距离计算配位数及连通团簇。","Coordination number and connected clusters using spatial bins and minimum-image periodic distances."},
{"Requires unsampled data. Periodic neighbor search supports orthogonal and triclinic cells. Current analysis limit: 2 million atoms.","需要未采样数据。周期近邻搜索支持正交与三斜晶胞。当前分析上限为 200 万原子。","Requires unsampled data. Periodic neighbor search supports orthogonal and triclinic cells. Current analysis limit: 2 million atoms."},
{"Files larger than this budget use deterministic stride sampling. All records are scanned; only preview atoms are retained.","超出预算时使用确定性步长采样。扫描全部记录，仅保留预览原子。","Files larger than this budget use deterministic stride sampling. All records are scanned; only preview atoms are retained."},
{"Hundreds of millions of full-resolution atoms and advanced OVITO analysis are development targets, not validated capabilities.","数亿全分辨率原子和高级分析属于开发目标，尚未验证。","Hundreds of millions of full-resolution atoms and advanced OVITO analysis are development targets, not validated capabilities."},
{"GRO uses nm, fixed-width 3 decimal coordinates, and at most 99999 atoms. Residues are exported as MOL; topology is not retained.","GRO 使用 nm、固定 3 位小数坐标，最多 99999 原子。残基导出为 MOL，不保留拓扑。","GRO uses nm, fixed-width 3 decimal coordinates, and at most 99999 atoms. Residues are exported as MOL; topology is not retained."},
{"Particle positions are grouped by type. POSCAR does not preserve arbitrary properties or non-periodic flags.","原子坐标按类型分组。POSCAR 不保存任意属性或非周期标志。","Particle positions are grouped by type. POSCAR does not preserve arbitrary properties or non-periodic flags."},
{"P1 structure; cell lengths/angles and fractional positions. The reader uses the conventional cell orientation.","P1 结构；保留晶胞长度、角度与分数坐标。读取时使用标准晶胞取向。","P1 structure; cell lengths/angles and fractional positions. The reader uses the conventional cell orientation."},
{"Atomic style; sequential IDs; no masses or bonds. Boundary flags are not stored by this format.","Atomic 样式；连续编号；不保存质量、键或边界标志。","Atomic style; sequential IDs; no masses or bonds. Boundary flags are not stored by this format."},
{"id, type, element, x, y, z; sequential IDs per frame. Restricted triclinic cells and periodic flags are preserved.","id、type、element、x、y、z；每帧连续编号。保留受限三斜晶胞和周期标志。","id, type, element, x, y, z; sequential IDs per frame. Restricted triclinic cells and periodic flags are preserved."},
{"Basic XYZ contains only species and positions; cell and additional properties are omitted.","基础 XYZ 仅包含元素和坐标；省略晶胞和其他属性。","Basic XYZ contains only species and positions; cell and additional properties are omitted."},
{"The loaded data is sampled. Increase the import budget and reload to export full data.","已加载数据经过采样。请增加导入预算并重新加载后再导出完整数据。","The loaded data is sampled. Increase the import budget and reload to export full data."},
